H33 (NOISE) — Boltyn: the first charge pick keeps the cards only another card's charge pays off
(Valiant Thrust, Courageous Steelhand; judge.ridesCharge), gate SPXCHARGEKEEP, key chargeKeep.
Census (3 seeds, 96 games): 48 of 453 first charges put a rider into the soul, 32 with a plain card beside it;
the patch changes 12 calls in 96 games.
A/B (SPXCHARGEKEEP=none vs on, SPXCLOAK on both sides):
  12 seeds: boltyn seat A 55 -> 57, seat B 71 -> 69 (126 -> 126 of 384)
  24 seeds: boltyn seat A 110 -> 115, seat B 128 -> 129 (238 -> 244 of 768). 0 refusals / violations / stalls.
Drill test/chargekeep.test.js passes and fails under sabotage (ride always 0). Not shipped: noise.
Apply on top of the SPXCLOAK commit; test/explain.test.js's unreached pin did not move.

